<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Backup section strings.

    IMPORTANT: None of these keys may also appear in strings.xml.
    The Android resource merger fails hard with "Duplicate resources"
    if the same string name is declared twice, even across files.
    All backup_* keys live ONLY here.

    Why this file exists at all:
      Arabic text written directly in Kotlin (.kt) source occasionally picks
      up invisible bidi marks or "smart quotes" while editing, and those break
      the Kotlin parser in confusing ways. Keeping the Arabic in XML eliminates
      that class of bug and makes translation straightforward later.
-->
